ngs?\" That would help.\n\nBut we need to produce a public message now. We can propose provisional recommendation for Candidate C, but note concerns and ask for clarification.\n\nThus: \"I think Candidate C is currently strongest due to reliability and decision quality, but I am concerned about communication and willingness to develop. I'd like to ask Agent 3 for more detail on communication.\"\n\nWe need to include vote in metadata. Vote: Candidate C.\n\nProceed."}
